            "notes": "[Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) is great and helps you survive, especially if you play cover well. It also generates money, this should ALWAYS be picked.\n\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) and [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) or [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).\n\nOR\n\nTwo HP items with [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for games where you think you will struggle to stay alive because of burst and annoying heroes, think D.Va, Genji or Freja.",
