            "notes": "More green HP items: you want to have 2 at minimum, but you can get up to 5, which is the maximum. You can sell [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) if it helps to reach 2 or 3 green HP items. I usually sell it unless I'm stuck with less than 1500 cash for another HP item.\n\nIf you have a lot of money, you can get [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09), only buy it if you have 2 green HP items already though. Against AP heavy teams you could get [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214), but early game is more WP heavy so I prefer [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09).",
