            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:11:31.130524+00:00",
            "notes": "For powers, in most rounds you should go for [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c). It generates more money and heals you when you shoot a discorded target. If the enemy team has a lot of annoying heroes like Genji, Freja, or D.Va, then [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) is a good alternative.\n\nSometimes I\u2019ll pick [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) if there are easy to headshot heroes and few or no threats.\n\nFor items, in most rounds I go for [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8). Zen benefits a lot from the extra HP, and its effect pairs really well with [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c). If you wanna go the defensive route but you dont have a lot of money, then [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is good or even better if they have heroes that deal 100 damage in one hit like Cass, Freja, Junkrat, Soldier(AP), Ashe, Rein(AP), \n\nIf you want to take the damage route, you can sell a green item for [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f), or pick up [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) by selling either [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or a green HP item. \n\nIf you have even more money you can get [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), but in most cases, if you have more money, you should get [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09).",
