            "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:11:31.130524+00:00",
            "notes": "In most games I will go [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) because for the most part Zen just needs to survive, have good LOS and deal damage to win, so this power helps with that.\n\nIf you aren't dying and you are ahead then [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) is good as well. It's particularly powerful against non-tanky enemies and enemies that are easy to headshot like an Ashe, Zen, Cass or Orisa.\n\nFor items it's [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) in most games. The armor is useful and it's good damage. Alternatives are [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf) or  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce).\n\n[El-sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) is also great. If you have enough money, [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) should be sold for [El-sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) as the 30% debuff is super powerful this late into the game. It's particularly good on Zen because you are already shooting tank a lot.\n\nYou can upgrade [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with a rare item of your choice if enough money as well.",
