        {
            "id": "449a7582-d2da-4ac8-b331-11e9bcebf6b3",
            "build_id": "528781fe-3ee1-427d-b2ea-e123d5cfe3ce",
            "round_number": 6,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:11:31.130524+00:00",
            "notes": "Just more damage basically, [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) or [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) \n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is an all-around very solid item; 25 armor is lovely and it is basically 10% AS and 10% WP.\n\n[The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) should almost always be picked if ahead. This will kill enemies really fast, especially if you have [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62).\n\n[El-sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) is a very powerful item as well. The item missing 5% damage is no big deal; if you headshot someone who has Discord on them, it's very likely they die because they can't outheal the 30% healing debuff and 30% damage boost. This can also replace [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if you have enough money.\n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) should be picked vs. armor and is also the best budget option.\n\n[Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) is similar to [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) but a bit safer. Usually, I prefer [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) though.",
