        {
            "id": "068b3d08-9b21-40d9-a621-6df643f31451",
            "build_id": "528781fe-3ee1-427d-b2ea-e123d5cfe3ce",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:11:31.130524+00:00",
            "notes": "[Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) allows you to trans your team/tank and still get potentially another ult in the same fight. It also makes you harder to kill.\n\n[Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) is still very useful and so is [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) if you feel like you need more damage.\n\nThis late into the game you mostly have to decide on your own what you want to play. We should only sell [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) for major upgrades like another epic item. \n\nIf you don't have money for 6 epic items, then you should for sure keep [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a). If there's armor you might wanna replace it with [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).\n\nFor the main new item it should be [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) because it's the most damage and lets us keep the slot for [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) by running more expensive items but keeping a rare one.\n\n### IMPORTANT\n\nThe other item that I will often get is [El-sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100). This is really powerful since Discord and 30% healing reduction is really hard to outheal. Enemies explode with [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce), discord, and [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62). This should replace [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) or [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) in games with heavy heavy healing and self sustained heroes like Moira, JQ, Mei, Lucio or Zen.\n\nI don't like running two defensive items usually but if you need more tanky you can choose items that have a bit of HP like [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) or [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121). Lifesteal and some more AP is fine as well with items like [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643).\n\nSome more items are in the optional items below. Generally you want items that give HP and/or damage.",
